Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.36,0:23:51.98,EDCN2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,316,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(7391,7620,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}不管明天如何难过也能笑容以对
